        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86112, Traditional Rope Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rope Cabinet Knob is a classic. It is available in a wide array of finish color options. The Cabinet Rope Knob is available in several finish colors including polished chrome and black. The Traditional Rope Cabinet Knob comes in 3 sizes, so choose the one that will look best on your size kitchen cabinet. Each cabinet pull comes packaged with the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86112-specifications.gif?v=1704354750\" width=\"593\" height=\"170\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Emtek 86112 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Rope Kitchen Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86112:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86113:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86202:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
